<title>USA: Agway year net profit $11.6 mln vs loss $15.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Agway year net profit $11.6 mln vs loss $15.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYRACUSE, N.Y. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agway said Monday it had net earnings for the 12 months ended June 30 of $11.6 million, on total sales of $1.66 billion.</p>
<p>This compares with fiscal 1995's net loss of $15.9 million, on total sales of $1.59 billion, Agway said.  </p>
<p>Overall, Agway Agricultural Products' sales revenues increased 17 percent over last year, principally due to the increased market price of feed and crop ingredients, the company said.</p>
</text>
